Triage order on macOS:
> 1) Docker Desktop not running (most common) → open it and wait for *Engine running*;
> 2) the system extension blocked → System Settings → Privacy & Security → Allow;
> 3) an old Docker Desktop without the Compose plugin → update it; 3b) the host bash is
> 3.2 → the container (or `brew install bash`) for anything with associative arrays;
> 4) corporate proxy/VPN blocking pulls → fallback path for M00–M08 and defer Docker to M09.
